#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:419
msgid "Automated apply"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_manual/ekos-tilt-correction.rst:421
msgid ""
"When the Aberration Inspector detects a connected ETA (and the plate is set "
"to 3-point), the ``Apply to ETA`` button becomes active. Clicking it reads "
"the current ETA positions, adds the advisory delta to each point, shifts all "
"values to stay within 0.000–1.200 mm, and sends the targets sequentially "
"(Point 1 → wait for arrival → Point 2 → …). A confirmation is displayed, e."
"g. \"Applied to ETA: P1→X.XXX P2→X.XXX P3→X.XXX mm\"."
msgstr ""

